{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20043","headline":"上达奚舍人 · 孟郊","name":"上达奚舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北山少日月，草木苦风霜。\n贫士在重坎，食梅有酸肠。\n万俗皆走圆，一身犹学方。\n常恐衆毁至，春叶成秋黄。\n大贤秉高鉴，公烛无私光。\n暗室晓未及，幽行涕空行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}